    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25740" root="ضرح" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرَاحِ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَامِ</span>, (K, TA,) is a verbal noun
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزَالِ</span>, (TA,) meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِضْرَحْ</span>, (K, TA,) i. e.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اُبْعُدْ</span>: you say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرَاحِ عَنْهُ</span> <i>Remove thou to a
distance,</i> or <i>go far away, from him,</i> or <i>it.</i> (TA.)


